  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Brand introduction</span></strong>: <span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(55, 65, 81); color: rgb(55, 65, 81); font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); float: none; display: inline;\">Archer is a New England-based lifestyle brand that utilizes only the finest Italian wools to create each and every performance-driven trouser.</span><br><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product description: </strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">TPTs: <span style=\"text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 60, 84); color: rgb(0, 60, 84); font-family: Zurich, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;\">The TPTs are the perfect blend of performance and luxury.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 60, 84); color: rgb(0, 60, 84); font-family: Zurich, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">The TPTs combine the functionality of performance pants with the refined style of luxury tailored trousers. </span><span style=\"text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 60, 84); color: rgb(0, 60, 84); font-family: Zurich, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;\">Made from a machine-washable, superfine Italian merino wool fabric with a perfect amount of stretch, these trousers are lightweight, soft, and comfortable. They are perfect for any occasion from the office, travel, date night to the golf course. The TPTs are designed to adapt to any weather condition, be it cool, warm, hot, or humid.</span><br><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">GPTs: <span style=\"text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 60, 84); color: rgb(0, 60, 84); font-family: Zurich, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">The GPT 2.0s are the perfect combination of performance and luxury Italian tailoring. Constructed from a machine-washable, superfine Italian merino wool fabric, these pants are lightweight, incredibly soft, odor-resistant, breathable, and stretchy. They are perfect for any occasion, be it the office, travel, date night, or even the golf course and are designed for year-round wear.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></span> Handmade in America from superfine Italian merino wool. Custom made trousers. Made from a 100% superfine Italian 120s merino wool. Moisture wicking, odor resistant, thermal regulating, breathable, super soft, ultra lightweight and machine washable. Archer is hyperfocused on sustainability. Archer works with the only mill in the world that is both EMAS and B-Corp certified. All wool is ZQRX certified.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
